wnload inputs, inspect bundle bytes or contact a provider. Returns explicit before_dispatch and verify_after_start requirements; valid is not provider eligibility.","responses":{"200":{"description":"Offline admission validation result","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/job-validation.v1alpha1.schema.json"}}},"headers":{"X-Request-ID":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RequestID"}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error400WithHeaders"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error401WithHeaders"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error403WithHeaders"},"404":{"description":"Referenced input not found or not visible","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/error.v1alpha1.schema.json"}}},"headers":{"X-Request-ID":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RequestID"}}},"408":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error408WithHeaders"},"413":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error413WithHeaders"},"415":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error415WithHeaders"},"422":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error422"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error429WithHeaders"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error503WithHeaders"}},"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/job-spec.v1alpha1.schema.json"}}}}}},"/v1/workspaces/{workspace_id}/jobs":{"parameters":[{"name":"workspace_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/common.v1alpha1.schema.json#/$defs/workspace_id"}}],"post":{"summary":"Durably accept an immutable job","operationId":"createJob","x-implementation-status":"implemented-offline","description":"Requires write scope and exactly one printable-ASCII Idempotency-Key (8-256 bytes, no whitespace). One transaction persists canonical request hash, frozen profile revision and object pins, job, initial attempt/nonce, accepted event and original receipt. Same workspace/operation/key and equivalent request replay the original queued receipt and IDs; changed request conflicts. Current authorization is always checked, but replay does not remap the profile or re-fetch URLs. 202 is local acceptance only. Pending HTTPS sources and bundle bytes require preparation before dispatch. Scheduler and provider execution are not implemented by this operation.","responses":{"202":{"description":"Job accepted locally, or original receipt replayed with idempotency_replay=true","headers":{"Location":{"description":"Job status URI","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uri-reference"}},"X-Request-ID":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RequestID"}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/job-admission.v1alpha1.schema.json"}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error400WithHeaders"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error401WithHeaders"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error403WithHeaders"},"404":{"description":"Referenced input not found or not visible","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/error.v1alpha1.schema.json"}}},"headers":{"X-Request-ID":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RequestID"}}},"408":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error408WithHeaders"},"409":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error409"},"413":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error413WithHeaders"},"415":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error415WithHeaders"},"422":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error422"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error429WithHeaders"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error503WithHeaders"}},"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/job-spec.v1alpha1.schema.json"}}}},"parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":8,"maxLength":256,"pattern":"^[!-~]{8,256}$"}}]}},"/v1/workspaces/{workspace_id}/jobs/{job_id}":{"parameters":[{"name":"workspace_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/common.v1alpha1.schema.json#/$defs/workspace_id"}},{"name":"job_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/common.v1alpha1.schema.json#/$defs/job_id"}}],"get":{"summary":"Read one job and active attempt state","operationId":"getJob","x-implementation-status":"implemented-offline","description":"Requires read scope. Returns durable cached state only, without polling a provider or triggering work. Source URLs, commands, credential references and private profile configuration are not serialized. Events/attempt/artifact links reserve contract locations; their collection routes remain planned.","responses":{"200":{"description":"Job status","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/job-status.v1alpha1.schema.json"}}},"headers":{"X-Request-ID":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RequestID"}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error400WithHeaders"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error401WithHeaders"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error403WithHeaders"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error404"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error429WithHeaders"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error503WithHeaders"}}}},"/v1/workspaces/{workspace_id}/jobs/{job_id}/cancel":{"parameters":[{"name":"workspace_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/common.v1alpha1.schema.json#/$defs/workspace_id"}},{"name":"job_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/common.v1alpha1.schema.json#/$defs/job_id"}}],"post":{"summary":"Persist cancellation intent","operationId":"cancelJob","x-implementation-status":"implemented-offline","responses":{"202":{"description":"Durable local receipt; replay=true returns the original operation receipt, not a fresh execution or current revision","headers":{"X-Request-ID":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RequestID"},"Location":{"description":"Read this URI for the current durable operation revision","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uri-reference"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/control-operation.v1alpha1.schema.json"}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error400WithHeaders"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error401WithHeaders"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error403WithHeaders"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error404WithHeaders"},"405":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error405WithHeaders"},"408":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error408WithHeaders"},"409":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error409WithHeaders"},"413":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error413WithHeaders"},"415":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error415WithHeaders"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error429WithHeaders"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error503WithHeaders"}},"tags":["operations"],"description":"Requires operate scope and exactly one printable-ASCII Idempotency-Key (8-256 bytes, no whitespace). The JSON body must name the target attempt_id; there is no implicit active attempt. Body limit is 4096 bytes and non-secret reason limit is 512 UTF-8 bytes. Same workspace/kind/key and canonical request replay the original receipt, even after later state changes; changed requests conflict. Read Location for current operation status. No provider call is made by this handler. Persists cancellation intent and prevents new dispatch where possible. Otherwise the separately composed worker uses one committed, capability-verified cancellation call against the exact binding. Acknowledgement does not prove termination; unsupported or uncertain cancellation remains manual_required and retains possible remote capacity. Cleanup is never cancellation.","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":8,"maxLength":256,"pattern":"^[!-~]{8,256}$"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/control-request.v1alpha1.schema.json"}}}}}},"/v1/workspaces/{workspace_id}/jobs/{job_id}/retry":{"parameters":[{"name":"workspace_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/common.v1alpha1.schema.json#/$defs/workspace_id"}},{"name":"job_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/common.v1alpha1.schema.json#/$defs/job_id"}}],"post":{"summary":"Create an explicit new compute attempt","operationId":"retryJob","x-implementation-status":"implemented-offline","responses":{"202":{"description":"Durable local receipt; replay=true returns the original operation receipt, not a fresh execution or current revision","headers":{"X-Request-ID":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RequestID"},"Location":{"description":"Read this URI for the current durable operation revision","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uri-reference"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/control-operation.v1alpha1.schema.json"}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error400WithHeaders"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error401WithHeaders"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error403WithHeaders"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error404WithHeaders"},"405":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error405WithHeaders"},"408":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error408WithHeaders"},"409":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error409WithHeaders"},"413":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error413WithHeaders"},"415":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error415WithHeaders"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error429WithHeaders"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error503WithHeaders"}},"parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":8,"maxLength":256,"pattern":"^[!-~]{8,256}$"}}],"tags":["operations"],"description":"Requires operate scope and exactly one printable-ASCII Idempotency-Key (8-256 bytes, no whitespace). The JSON body must name the target attempt_id; there is no implicit active attempt. Body limit is 4096 bytes and non-secret reason limit is 512 UTF-8 bytes. Same workspace/kind/key and canonical request replay the original receipt, even after later state changes; changed requests conflict. Read Location for current operation status. No provider call is made by this handler. Requires a nonblank reason. Rejects unresolved or possibly active execution, and directs successful execution with missing results to collect. Verifies the original frozen local bytes, then atomically creates one new attempt/nonce and queue entry while preserving the job, provider binding and history. It never re-fetches a URL. The receipt names the source attempt_id and distinct new_attempt_id.","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/control-request.v1alpha1.schema.json#/$defs/retry"}}}}}},"/v1/workspaces/{workspace_id}/jobs/{job_id}/reconcile":{"parameters":[{"name":"workspace_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/common.v1alpha1.schema.json#/$defs/workspace_id"}},{"name":"job_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/common.v1alpha1.schema.json#/$defs/job_id"}}],"post":{"summary":"Reconcile existing provider identity without new compute","operationId":"reconcileJob","x-implementation-status":"implemented-offline","responses":{"202":{"description":"Durable local receipt; replay=true returns the original operation receipt, not a fresh execution or current revision","headers":{"X-Request-ID":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RequestID"},"Location":{"description":"Read this URI for the current durable operation revision","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uri-reference"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/control-operation.v1alpha1.schema.json"}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error400WithHeaders"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error401WithHeaders"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error403WithHeaders"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error404WithHeaders"},"405":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error405WithHeaders"},"408":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error408WithHeaders"},"409":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error409WithHeaders"},"413":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error413WithHeaders"},"415":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error415WithHeaders"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error429WithHeaders"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error503WithHeaders"}},"tags":["operations"],"description":"Requires operate scope and exactly one printable-ASCII Idempotency-Key (8-256 bytes, no whitespace). The JSON body must name the target attempt_id; there is no implicit active attempt. Body limit is 4096 bytes and non-secret reason limit is 512 UTF-8 bytes. Same workspace/kind/key and canonical request replay the original receipt, even after later state changes; changed requests conflict. Read Location for current operation status. No provider call is made by this handler. Requests observation of an existing identity, never another submission or staging mutation. A previously terminal attempt can return its cached resolved outcome without a provider call. Permanent identity/privacy failures do not rearm unsafe work.","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":8,"maxLength":256,"pattern":"^[!-~]{8,256}$"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/control-request.v1alpha1.schema.json"}}}}}},"/v1/workspaces/{workspace_id}/jobs/{job_id}/collect":{"parameters":[{"name":"workspace_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/common.v1alpha1.schema.json#/$defs/workspace_id"}},{"name":"job_id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/common.v1alpha1.schema.json#/$defs/job_id"}}],"post":{"summary":"Retry collection without rerunning compute","operationId":"collectJob","x-implementation-status":"implemented-offline","responses":{"202":{"description":"Durable local receipt; replay=true returns the original operation receipt, not a fresh execution or current revision","headers":{"X-Request-ID":{"$ref":"#/components/headers/RequestID"},"Location":{"description":"Read this URI for the current durable operation revision","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uri-reference"}}},"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/control-operation.v1alpha1.schema.json"}}}},"400":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error400WithHeaders"},"401":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error401WithHeaders"},"403":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error403WithHeaders"},"404":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error404WithHeaders"},"405":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error405WithHeaders"},"408":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error408WithHeaders"},"409":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error409WithHeaders"},"413":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error413WithHeaders"},"415":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error415WithHeaders"},"429":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error429WithHeaders"},"503":{"$ref":"#/components/responses/Error503WithHeaders"}},"tags":["operations"],"description":"Requires operate scope and exactly one printable-ASCII Idempotency-Key (8-256 bytes, no whitespace). The JSON body must name the target attempt_id; there is no implicit active attempt. Body limit is 4096 bytes and non-secret reason limit is 512 UTF-8 bytes. Same workspace/kind/key and canonical request replay the original receipt, even after later state changes; changed requests conflict. Read Location for current operation status. No provider call is made by this handler. Creates a durable transfer-only ticket for an explicitly identified attempt with terminal execution evidence. The artifact verifier and ticket consumer remain M3-06: accepted/collection_requested does not promise transfer execution or published results. Already verified available results may return results_available.","parameters":[{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":8,"maxLength":256,"pattern":"^[!-~]{8,256}$"}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"./schemas/control-request.v1alpha1.schema.json"}}}}}},"/v1/workspaces/{workspace_id}/operations/{operation_id}":{"pa